assertion A0 : stm0 is deadlock-free in the failures model
assertion A1 : ctrl0 is deadlock-free in the failures model
assertion A2 : mod0 is deadlock-free in the failures model

csp CBehaviour csp-begin

CBehaviour = ctrl0::registerRead.ctrl0::i_e1.true?x -> ctrl0::registerRead.ctrl0::i_e3.false?_ -> ctrl0::endexec -> tock -> 
             ctrl0::registerRead.ctrl0::i_e3.false?_ -> ctrl0::registerRead.ctrl0::i_e3.false?_ -> ctrl0::endexec -> tock -> 
             ctrl0::registerWrite.ctrl0::o_e2.x -> ctrl0::endexec -> tock -> CBehaviour

csp-end
 
csp MBehaviour csp-begin

MBehaviour = mod0::registerRead.mod0::i_e1.true?x -> mod0::registerRead.mod0::i_e2.false?_ ->   
			tock -> mod0::registerRead.mod0::i_e1.false?_ -> mod0::registerRead.mod0::i_e2.false?_ -> tock -> mod0::registerWrite.mod0::o_e3.x -> tock -> MBehaviour

csp-end

assertion A3 : CBehaviour refines ctrl0 in the traces model
assertion A4 : MBehaviour refines mod0 in the traces model